Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 00:15:30 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): offer all machine kinds in the Machines pane filter

Add Waterjet, Wire EDM and Sinker EDM without changing the existing filter indices. Pin all seven dropdown entries and their filtered rows.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #2030
---
